{"version":1,"key":"card:213","content":{"id":213,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在所有的节点中，只有 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"DocumentFragment","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在文档中没有对应的标记。DOM 规定 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"DocumentFragment","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是一种轻量级的文档，它可以包含和控制节点，但是不会真正的文档占用额外的资源，它相关 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Node","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性如下："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"nodeType","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：11"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"nodeName","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"："},{"type":"formatted","text":"#document-fragment","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"nodeValue","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"："},{"type":"formatted","text":"null","code":true}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一般将 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"DocumentFragment","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 当做一个仓库来使用，将要添加到文档树中的节点先添加到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"DocumentFragment","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中，因为如果大批量的向文档树种添加节点时，如果一个个像浏览器添加节点，就会导致浏览器反复渲染，如果我们将节点先添加到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"DocumentFragment","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中，然后在将 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"DocumentFragment","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 添加到文档树中，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"DocumentFragment","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会将它包含的节点一次性添加到文档树("},{"type":"formatted","text":"DocumentFragment","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 并不会被添加到文档树中)，这样可以提高浏览器的性能。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有下面的一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"ul","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 节点"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<ul id=\"list\"></ul>","language":"html","uuid":"8cee9648-6040-4873-8326-2c32eb60a44f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们需要将下面的节点添加到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"ul","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<li>item1</li>\n<li>item2</li>\n<li>item3</li>","language":"html","uuid":"d17379eb-5c9c-4a20-b730-d62df37ba611","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们可以先将 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"li","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 元素添加到一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"DocumentFragment","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中，然后在添加到文档数中，如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"let ul = document.getElementById(\"list\");\n// 创建一个 DocumentFragment\nlet fragment = document.createDocumentFragment();\n\nfor (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n  let li = document.createElement(\"li\");\n  li.appendChild(document.createTextNode(\"item\" + (i + 1)));\n  fragment.appendChild(li);\n}\n\nul.appendChild(fragment);","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"43c12f10-abae-45a2-8d48-5be94580d11e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["DOM"],"createTime":1690699489187,"updateTime":1743303640410,"linkedCards":[{"id":198,"target":{"key":"card:198","type":"card","id":198},"summary":"DOM 定义了一个 Node 类型的接口，DOM 树上的节点都实现了该类型，因此所有的节点都有着 Node 接口中规定的属性和方法。 虽然 HTML 元素以及文本内容都会被转化为节点，但是明显 document 节点，HTML 元素节点，以...","tags":["DOM"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640410}}